<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sees '98 govt borrowing -10-0 bln SKR.</title>
<headline>Sweden sees '98 govt borrowing -10-0 bln SKR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office on Wednesday estimated the central government borrowing requirement for 1998 would be between minus 10 to zero billion crowns.</p>
</text>
